    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-24" id="fn-24" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="text-align:justify">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:118%">On March 6, 2025, the commission issued an order in Docket No. ES25-30-000 authorizing us to issue mortgage bonds, term loans, intercompany advance agreements, or other long-term debt in an amount not to exceed $300 million outstanding at any one time.</span>
      </div>
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="text-align:justify">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:118%">On August 1, 2025, ITC Holdings made an advance to us of $50 million with a maturity date of August 1, 2027. As of December 31, 2025, there was an additional $250 million of authorization remaining. See Note 7 Long Term Debt on page 123 for additional information.</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
